OL,3,GNEWSAInfluencer 'had no idea' about
OL,4,A#140k watch robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn influencer accused of helping to rob
OL,7,Fa fashion designer of his
OL,8,Fdiamond-encrusted watch in London's
OL,9,FMayfair had "no idea" the attack was
OL,10,Fgoing to happen, a court has heard.
OL,12,FRomanian entrepreneur Catalin Botezatu
OL,13,Fhad been having dinner before he was
OL,14,Fallegedly robbed of his Richard Mille
OL,15,Fwatch - worth more than #137,000 - by
OL,16,Fthree men, Southwark Crown Court was
OL,17,Ftold.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
