OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAInfluencer 'had no idea' about
OL,4,A#140k watch robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbdel El Habchi, 30, who told the jury
OL,7,Fhe has an online following of more than
OL,8,Fa million people in his native Morocco,
OL,9,Fsaid he "didn't know even that a watch
OL,10,Fwas snatched or stolen until later on".
OL,12,FCo-accused Ali Eldahouzze, 22, also
OL,13,Fdenies robbery, while a third man,
OL,14,FYounes Djoudi, has pleaded guilty to
OL,15,Fthe offence.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
